FEATURES OVERVIEW

📨 BULK MESSAGING
Send messages to thousands of users, groups, and channels simultaneously. Support for private chats, group members, channel subscribers, and contact lists.

📝 MESSAGE TYPES
- Text messages with formatting
- Images and photos
- Videos and GIFs
- Documents and files
- Polls and quizzes
- Voice messages
- Stickers and emoji

🎯 TARGET SOURCES
- Group members (scrape and message)
- Channel subscribers
- Private contacts
- CSV import (usernames/phone numbers)
- Phone book contacts
- Nearby users (geolocation)

⏰ SMART SCHEDULING
Set specific dates and times for messages. Recurring schedules (daily, weekly, monthly). Timezone-aware delivery. Queue management for large campaigns.

🛡️ ANTI-BAN PROTECTION
- Random delays between messages
- Daily sending limits (50-500 per account)
- Proxy support (HTTP/SOCKS5)
- Multi-account rotation
- Auto-stop on flags
- Message randomization (avoid patterns)

🤖 AUTO REPLY
Set up automatic responses for incoming messages. Keyword-based replies. Away messages. Business hours only mode. Smart AI responses (premium).

📊 CAMPAIGN ANALYTICS
- Messages sent counter
- Delivery success rate
- Read receipts tracking
- Reply tracking
- Blocked count
- Daily limits remaining

